  "description": {
   "en": "22 years old, aspiring manga artist, with an uncertain future. Suddenly, the \"Mud Man\" appears before him. Ochiai recognizes the \"Mud Man\" who emits such a foul odor that it kills the fish in Lake Biwa. Yes, that man is a character from a manga that Ochiai has drawn. Will fiction become reality? The battle of Ochiai, who has supernatural powers, begins!"
